{
  "_comment": [
    "juzheng 默认 sing-box 配置模板。",
    "流量架构：",
    "  命中解密域名的流量 → TUN(tun-in) → route[inbound=tun-in + 解密域名] → go-mitmproxy:9080(解密)",
    "           → go-mitmproxy upstream → mixed(mixed-back:1081) → route[inbound=mixed-back] → 节点 outbound → 出网",
    "  其余流量 → TUN(tun-in) → 节点 outbound 直出，不解密。",
    "",
    "使用前必改：",
    "  1. outbounds[proxy-node] 替换为你的真实节点（vmess/trojan/ss/hysteria2 等）。",
    "  2. TUN 的 auto_route 需要 root 权限（由 privileged helper 提供）。",
    "  3. 明文抓包域名默认空，由用户在「明文抓包」里按需配置。",
    "",
    "端口约定：",
    "  9080 = go-mitmproxy（MITM 解密，由 juzheng MitmProxyService 管理，此处仅作 outbound 目标）",
    "  1081 = mixed-back（MITM 解密后回注入口）",
    "  9090 = sing-box Clash API（可选，供调试/节点切换）"
  ],
  "log": {
    "level": "info",
    "timestamp": true
  },
  "dns": {
    "servers": [
      {
        "tag": "cloudflare",
        "address": "https://1.1.1.1/dns-query",
        "detour": "proxy-node"
      },
      {
        "tag": "local",
        "address": "223.5.5.5",
        "detour": "direct"
      }
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "outbound": "any",
        "server": "local"
      }
    ],
    "strategy": "ipv4_only"
  },
  "inbounds": [
    {
      "type": "tun",
      "tag": "tun-in",
      "address": [
        "172.18.0.1/30"
      ],
      "mtu": 1500,
      "auto_route": true,
      "strict_route": true,
      "stack": "system"
    },
    {
      "type": "mixed",
      "tag": "mixed-back",
      "listen": "127.0.0.1",
      "listen_port": 9788
    }
  ],
  "outbounds": [
    {
      "_comment": "【必改】替换为你的真实代理节点。此处为占位 direct，实际使用时填 vmess/trojan/hysteria2 等。",
      "type": "direct",
      "tag": "proxy-node"
    },
    {
      "type": "direct",
      "tag": "direct"
    },
    {
      "_comment": "把需解密的流量以 HTTP CONNECT 发给 go-mitmproxy。",
      "type": "http",
      "tag": "to-mitmproxy",
      "server": "127.0.0.1",
      "server_port": 9080
    }
  ],
  "route": {
    "rules": [
      {
        "action": "sniff"
      },
      {
        "_comment": "回环打破兜底：mixed-back 回注的流量优先按代理组/节点规则分流，未匹配的走 proxy-node 兜底。to-mitmproxy 规则限定 inbound:tun-in，mixed-back 流量不会重复解密。",
        "inbound": [
          "mixed-back"
        ],
        "outbound": "proxy-node"
      },
      {
        "_comment": "TUN 进来的、需解密(明文抓包)的域名 → 发给 go-mitmproxy。默认空，由用户在「明文抓包」里配置。",
        "inbound": [
          "tun-in"
        ],
        "domain_suffix": [],
        "outbound": "to-mitmproxy"
      },
      {
        "_comment": "DNS 查询走 dns-out。",
        "protocol": "dns",
        "action": "hijack-dns"
      }
    ],
    "final": "proxy-node",
    "auto_detect_interface": true
  },
  "experimental": {
    "cache_file": {
      "enabled": false
    },
    "clash_api": {
      "external_controller": "127.0.0.1:9090"
    }
  }
}